===Etymology===
{{etyl|fro}} {{term|estanson|lang=fro}}, {{term|estanchon|lang=fro}}, (Modern French {{term|étançon|lang=fr}}), from {{term|estance||a stay, a prop|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|stans||standing|lang=la}}, present participle of {{term|sto|stō|lang=la}}.

